      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happens because locally joystick and playspace movement are two different things, but remotely they're the same. This becomes obvious when you look at the behaviour of the velocity parameter in SDK3: moving in your playspace doesn't change it for you but it does for others.\nIn which case is this a problem though? I haven't encountered any so far (at least regarding your issue).",
