      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: I'm not sure if you are describing the same problem. The issue occurs even when no irl-in-playspace movement occurs. It's as if the object gets translated at 10x the amount. \nIt is a problem with any prop that is supposed to move with the avatar, such as a spawnable car. After any movement, the local player won't be able to see the car, as it will be too far away.",
      "viewerReactions": null
